      "card_id": "champ:renekton:overview:L1",
      "core_coverage": [
        {
          "answer_quote": "Renekton is a close-range fighter/tank whose basic abilities deal physical damage, with healing and a targeted stun; Dominus adds nearby magic damage.",
          "covered": true,
          "mechanic_id": "overview_fighting_role",
          "reason": "Explains his role, damage types, healing and targeted stun."
        },
        {
          "answer_quote": "His attacks build Fury that empowers abilities, giving him an AD damage focus. Slice is a damaging dash that unlocks a second dash only if it hits an enemy.",
          "covered": true,
          "mechanic_id": "overview_threat_access",
          "reason": "Explains Fury empowerment and the hit condition for another dash."
        }
      ],
      "counterplay_grounded": true,
      "english": true,
      "facts_supported": false,
      "issues": [
        "“Fury that empowers abilities, giving him an AD damage focus” incorrectly makes AD orientation a consequence of Fury empowerment. The supplied AD scalings support the separately typed broad orientation, not this causal connection. Separate the statements, for example: “His attacks build Fury that empowers abilities. His basic abilities have an AD damage focus.”"
      ],
      "priority_reasonable": true
    },
