          "covered": true,
          "mechanic_id": "fury_generation_decay",
          "reason": "Explains generation, decay and increased generation at low health; the following exception qualifies empowered abilities."
        },
        {
          "answer_quote": "At least 50 Fury makes the next eligible basic ability consume 50 Fury for an empowered effect. Slice is excluded from this empowerment, and empowered abilities do not generate Fury.",
